# Gradle Wrapper JAR Information
# =================================
#
# The gradle-wrapper.jar file is required to run Gradle builds.
#
# How to get gradle-wrapper.jar:
#
# Option 1: Use Android Studio (Recommended)
# - Open this project in Android Studio
# - Android Studio will automatically download and set up Gradle Wrapper
#
# Option 2: Install Gradle manually and run:
#   gradle wrapper --gradle-version 8.2
#
# Option 3: Download from Maven Central:
#   URL: https://repo1.maven.org/maven2/org/gradle/gradle-wrapper/8.2/gradle-wrapper-8.2.jar
#   Save as: gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
#
# Option 4: Copy from another Gradle project
#   Copy gradle-wrapper.jar from another working Android/Gradle project
#
# File location: gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
# File size: ~50 KB
# SHA-256 (for gradle-wrapper-8.2.jar): 
#   Check https://repo1.maven.org/maven2/org/gradle/gradle-wrapper/8.2/gradle-wrapper-8.2.jar.sha256
